{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:418603a9fa8668a6","name":"Genetically Modified Felucian","source":{"id":"source:reference-418603a9fa8668a6","title":"Genetically Modified Felucian","revision":21594,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:06:17Z","sha256":"87afdb2d3465234e986311b4dd68c566edc5cb9978f50775275d14045f422c20","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21594","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Genetically%20Modified%20Felucian&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-418603a9fa8668a6","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["The Traitor's Gambit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Traitor%27s_Gambit","referenceId":"reference:b765bce19fabefc4"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["This ",{"tag":"a","children":["Felucian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Felucian","referenceId":"reference:bb4efb879ff12e35"}," has clearly undergone some kind of mutation; its muscles bulge and its body seems to bend in unnatural places. The creature's right forearm has been removed entirely, and instead a long bone blade extends from the elbow, growing out of the flesh with a ragged, serrated edge. Thick, tough-looking scales grow out of the Felucian's body."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Captain Vischera's early experiments led to the creation of violent ",{"tag":"a","children":["Felucians"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Felucians"}," with weapons built into their bodies. By removing their right forearms and causing the bones of their elbows and upper arms to mutate, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Captain Vischera"],"hr